The AmgX adapter derives from openfoam-amgx by tasdingchen-alt,
revision f08d88ce8e63e4b35f9f05eef11f320c4d8ad183:
https://github.com/tasdingchen-alt/openfoam-amgx

The original GPL-3.0-or-later notices are retained in the derived files.
Modifications provide OpenCFD API compatibility, serial GPU coefficient
updates, precision-correct buffers, double-precision residual correction,
configuration-aware caching and mesh-scoped resource ownership.

This optional adapter is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later. It is built
separately from the membrane library. NVIDIA AmgX is an external dependency
and is not vendored here; its own license and notices apply.
